  "details": "When the Cache directory contains back slashes, it interprets the directory path differently.\nRepo steps: Change forward slash (/) to back slash (\\)\nExpected: Windows uses backslash as standard convention, and older versions of VRChat was able to use the Cache directory\nActual: VRC interprets the backslash as a escape character.\nThe log shows the Cache directory loaded as \"D:RCCache\" rather than the expected \"D:\\VRCCache\"\n2021.10.03 19:19:25 Log        -  [AssetBundleDownloadManager] Custom cache path set to: D:RCCache\n2021.10.03 19:19:25 Log        -  [AssetBundleDownloadManager] Using custom cache directory: D:RCCache\\Cache-WindowsPlayer\n2021.10.03 19:19:25 Log        -  [AssetBundleDownloadManager] Using default cache size: 20.00GB\n2021.10.03 19:19:25 Log        -  [AssetBundleDownloadManager] Using default cache expiry delay: 30.00 days\n2021.10.03 19:19:25 Log        -  [Always] Subscription Set Up Transaction Callbacks",
